# Binary Placeholder - zabbix_agent2 (Linux/macOS)
# 
# This placeholder indicates where the Zabbix Agent v2 executable should be placed.
# 
# Source: Zabbix official distribution
# Download from: https://www.zabbix.com/download_agents
# File: zabbix_agent2 (Linux/macOS, 64-bit)
# Typical size: ~8-12 MB
#
# Installation instructions:
# 1. Download the Zabbix agent 2 for your platform (Linux or macOS)
# 2. Extract zabbix_agent2 from the archive
# 3. Place it in this directory: lin/bin/
# 4. Make it executable: chmod +x lin/bin/zabbix_agent2
# 5. This file will be automatically excluded from git (see .gitignore)
